赋行於世。为黄门侍郎，与顾荣俱为侍臣。归命世内侍多得罪尤，惟荣、丞独获全。常使二人记事，丞答顾问，乃下诏曰：“自今已后，用侍郎皆当如今宗室丞、顾荣畴也。”吴平赴洛，为范阳涿令，甚有称绩。永安中，陆机为成都王大都督，请丞为司马，与机俱被害。","text_layer":"witness_appended_pei_songzhi_note","mentions":[{"id":"c-sanguozhi-051-huan-shuwu:line056-pei02-02:m0007","start":7,"end":8,"surface":"丞","kind":"person","person_id":"6k9_dku_2e4_AA","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"依本段姓名與上下文定位。"},{"id":"c-sanguozhi-051-huan-shuwu:line056-pei02-02:m0030","start":30,"end":32,"surface":"顾荣","kind":"person","person_id":"wtz_smr_dwz","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"依本段姓名與上下文定位。"},{"id":"c-sanguozhi-051-huan-shuwu:line056-pei02-02:m0037","start":37,"end":39,"surface":"归命","kind":"person","person_id":"05e_9bb_55a","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"依本段姓名與上下文定位。"},{"id":"c-sanguozhi-051-huan-shuwu:line056-pei02-02:m0048","start":48,"end":49,"surface":"荣","kind":"person","person_id":"wtz_smr_dwz","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"依本段姓名與上下文定位。"},{"id":"c-sanguozhi-051-huan-shuwu:line056-pei02-02:m0050","start":50,"end":51,"surface":"丞","kind":"person","person_id":"6k9_dku_2e4_AA","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"依本段姓名與上下文定位。"},{"id":"c-sanguozhi-051-huan-shuwu:line056-pei02-02:m0062","start":62,"end":63,"surface":"丞","kind":"person","person_id":"6k9_dku_2e4_AA","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"依本段姓名與上下文定位。"},{"id":"c-sanguozhi-051-huan-shuwu:line056-pei02-02:m0087","start":87,"end":88,"surface":"丞","kind":"person","person_id":"6k9_dku_2e4_AA","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"依本段姓名與上下文定位。"},{"id":"c-sanguozhi-051-huan-shuwu:line056-pei02-02:m0089","start":89,"end":91,"surface":"顾荣","kind":"person","person_id":"wtz_smr_dwz","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"依本段姓名與上下文定位。"},{"id":"c-sanguozhi-051-huan-shuwu:line056-pei02-02:m0115","start":115,"end":117,"surface":"陆机","kind":"person","person_id":"69h_uhy_hta","status":"contextual